.env.*.local
# The uncommitted secret file. `.env.*.local` above does not match it: `*` matches within one
# path segment, and this name has no second `.local`. Excluded explicitly because `COPY . .`
# would otherwise bake the live provider credentials into an image layer, where they survive
# every later `docker image rm` short of rebuilding from scratch. At runtime the container gets
# them from compose/the host environment, which is where they belong.
.env.local
